    - P-1

        If authenticator supports BioEnrollment API: Send authenticatorBioEnrollment(0x09) with getModality(0x06) set to true. Check that response is succesful and contains one field modality(0x01) set to one of the allowed modalities

    
    - P-2

        If authenticator supports BioEnrollment API: Send authenticatorBioEnrollment(0x09) with subCommand(0x06) set to getFingerprintSensorInfo(0x07), and modality(0x01) to the corresponding modality.

        Check that response is succesful, and that:
            (a) fingerprintKind(0x02) is a Number, and set to the allowed kind
            (b) maxCaptureSamplesRequiredForEnroll(0x02) is a number, and is bigger than 0
            (c) If maxTemplateFriendlyName is present, check that it is of type Number, and is bigger than 0

    

  

        Authr-BioEnrollment-BioModAndSensorInfo

        Test authenticatorBioEnrollment(0x09) command support for biometric enrolment

    
